{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3005009030010","name":"結華","text":"『ひどい雪……\r\nこれじゃあ、しばらくここから出られそうにないね』","trans":"“好大的雪……\n这样的话，好一阵子都出不去呢”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030020","name":"咲耶","text":"『──そうだね。けれど、この山小屋に\r\nお邪魔できたのは幸運だったと思うよ』","trans":"“——是啊。不过，能进这个山中小屋躲一躲，\n已经很幸运了”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030030","name":"霧子","text":"『あったかい……\r\nここなら……安心だね……』","trans":"“好温暖……\n在这里……就能安心呢……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030040","name":"恋鐘","text":"──ふぇ……\r\nみんななんしよっと？","trans":"——诶……\n大家在做什么？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030060","name":"摩美々","text":"……はい、カットー","trans":"……好，卡——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030070","name":"結華","text":"おっ、まみみんがカメラマン？\r\nいや、監督か","trans":"哦，美美当摄影师？\n不，是导演吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030080","name":"摩美々","text":"月岡さんＮＧー","trans":"月冈小姐，NG——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030090","name":"恋鐘","text":"ふぇ！？\r\nうち～～～！？","trans":"诶！？\n我～～～！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030100","name":"摩美々","text":"しっかり頼むよー","trans":"好好干啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030110","name":"咲耶","text":"これはこれは……\r\n厳しい監督だ","trans":"哎呀哎呀……\n真是严格的导演","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030120","name":"恋鐘","text":"これ、なんの撮影～～～？","trans":"这是拍什么～～～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030130","name":"結華","text":"雪の山小屋……これはもう\r\nエチュードせざるを得ない！　みたいな？","trans":"雪中的山间小屋……这就只能\n来段即兴表演了！　这样？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030150","name":"咲耶","text":"こうして日頃から演技力を磨いておくのも\r\n悪くは無いだろう","trans":"像这样平时就磨练演技\n倒也不错","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030160","name":"恋鐘","text":"ん～～～\r\nなるほど～～～？","trans":"嗯～～～\n原来如此～～～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030170","name":"摩美々","text":"──じゃーさっきの続きからぁ\r\n……アクションー","trans":"——那就从刚才继续\n……开拍——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030180","name":"咲耶","text":"『……私たちがここにいること、\r\nみんなはわかっているだろうか』","trans":"“……我们在这里，\n大家知道吗”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030190","name":"結華","text":"『もし、このまま誰にも\r\n気付いてもらえなかったら……』","trans":"“如果就这样一直\n没人发现我们的话……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030200","name":"恋鐘","text":"『ど、どうなると……！？』","trans":"“那、那会怎样……！？”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030220","name":"咲耶","text":"『……いや、それより今は\r\nみんなで身体を寄せ合って、凍えないようにしよう』","trans":"“……不，比起那个，现在\n大家互相靠紧，别冻着了”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030230","name":"霧子","text":"『うん……\r\nでも……』","trans":"“嗯……\n可是……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030240","name":"霧子","text":"『だんだん……\r\n眠く……なってきちゃった……』","trans":"“越来越……\n困了……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030250","name":"恋鐘","text":"『霧子！\r\n寝たらいかん～！』","trans":"“雾子！\n不能睡啊～！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030260","name":"霧子","text":"『…………すー……』","trans":"“…………呼——……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030270","name":"恋鐘","text":"『霧子～～～～～～～！』","trans":"“雾子～～～～～～～！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030280","name":"恋鐘","text":"……あ","trans":"……啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030300","name":"摩美々","text":"……カットー","trans":"……卡——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030310","name":"摩美々","text":"ちょっと、鳴ったの誰ー？\r\n月岡さんー？","trans":"等等，是谁的手机响了——？\n月冈小姐——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030320","name":"恋鐘","text":"うち……！\r\nメッセージの来た……！","trans":"是我……！\n来消息了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030340","name":"恋鐘","text":"『アンティーカのみんな、\r\nもう着いた？』やって～～～！","trans":"“L'Antica的各位，\n到了吗？”发来了～～～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030350","name":"咲耶","text":"フフ、連絡手段があるのなら、\r\n最悪の結末は回避できそうだ","trans":"呵呵，既然有联络手段，\n看来能避免最坏的结局了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030370","name":"霧子","text":"恋鐘ちゃんの……おかげ……","trans":"多亏了……恋钟……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030380","name":"結華","text":"うん、こがたんはグッジョブ！","trans":"嗯，小钟干得好！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030390","name":"結華","text":"……しかし三峰は要反省\r\nみんなを待たせてること、失念しておりました……！","trans":"……不过三峰需要反省\n我忘了大家都在等着这件事……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030400","name":"摩美々","text":"じゃーこれで\r\nクランクアップでー","trans":"那就这样\n杀青啦——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030420","name":"恋鐘","text":"は～い\r\nはよみんなの所に行かんばね～！","trans":"好～的\n得快点去大家那里才行～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030430","name":"結華","text":"よーし、ゲレンデまで急げー！","trans":"好——，快赶往滑雪场！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030450","name":"咲耶","text":"……摩美々？\r\n行かないのかい？","trans":"……摩美美？\n你不去吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030460","name":"摩美々","text":"うん\r\n今行くー","trans":"嗯\n这就去——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030470","name":"摩美々","text":"『全米が泣いた──』","trans":"“全美观众都哭了——”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030480","name":"摩美々","text":"『この冬一番の感動作──』","trans":"“这个冬天最感人的作品——”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030490","name":"摩美々","text":"『衝撃のラストを見逃すな──』","trans":"“别错过震撼的结局——”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030500","name":"摩美々","text":"ふふー\r\nいい感じー","trans":"呵呵——\n感觉不错——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030510","name":"摩美々","text":"『#月岡恋鐘』","trans":"“#月冈恋钟”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030520","name":"摩美々","text":"『#白瀬咲耶』","trans":"“#白濑咲耶”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030530","name":"摩美々","text":"『#三峰結華』","trans":"“#三峰结华”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030540","name":"摩美々","text":"『#幽谷霧子』","trans":"“#幽谷雾子”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030550","name":"摩美々","text":"『#田中摩美々』","trans":"“#田中摩美美”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030560","name":"摩美々","text":"──『#アンティーカ』","trans":"——“#L'Antica”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005009030570","name":"摩美々","text":"……ツイスタに動画投稿ー","trans":"……在Twista上发视频——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}